---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: Start Here
metaDescription: New to PetBuddyHub? This is the perfect place to begin your pet care journey. We've organized our best resources just for you.
permalink: /start-here/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome. Start Here</h1>
    <p>New to pet parenting or just found us? Here's everything you need, organized and easy to follow.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__header">
      <h2>Choose Your Path</h2>
      <p>Whether you're a brand-new pet owner or looking for specific advice, we've got you covered.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card fade-in">
        <div class="step-card__number">1</div>
        <h3>New Pet Owner?</h3>
        <p>Everything you need to know about bringing home your first pet, from puppy-proofing your house to choosing the right vet.</p>
        <a href="{{ '/blog/10-essential-tips-for-bringing-home-your-new-puppy/' | url }}" class="btn btn-ghost">Read the Guide {{ icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card fade-in">
        <div class="step-card__number">2</div>
        <h3>Nutrition & Food</h3>
        <p>Confused about what to feed your pet? Our nutrition guides break down the best foods, portion sizes, and dietary needs.</p>
        <a href="{{ '/blog/best-dog-food-brands-2026-guide/' | url }}" class="btn btn-ghost">Explore Food Guides {{ icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card fade-in">
        <div class="step-card__number">3</div>
        <h3>Training Essentials</h3>
        <p>From basic commands to behavior issues. Learn positive training techniques that actually work.</p>
        <a href="{{ '/categories/#training' | url }}" class="btn btn-ghost">Training Articles {{ icon("arrow-right", 16) }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__header">
      <h2>Most Popular Articles</h2>
      <p>These are our most-read articles that helped thousands of pet parents.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="posts-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
          {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="featured-banner fade-in">
      <div>
        <h2>Looking for Product Recommendations?</h2>
        <p>Check out our honest, hands-on reviews of the best pet products, from food to toys to grooming tools.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="{{ '/categories/#product-reviews' | url }}" class="btn">See Reviews</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="newsletter fade-in">
      <h2>Never Miss a Tip</h2>
      <p>Join our community and get the best pet care advice sent to your inbox weekly.</p>
      <form class="newsletter__form">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required aria-label="Email address">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
